+    8 their widths overlap and the order becomes irreversible. No level-4
+    win this session; the outer loop independently regression-checked the
+    EXISTING banked L3 prefix (unaffected by this session''s null) and
+    confirmed it still reproduces cleanly (3x fresh env.reset(), all 3
+    reached_level=3).'
